el risk assessment programs that collectively include each of the applicable requirement parts in CIP-004-6 Table R3-- Personnel Risk Assessment Program and additional evidence to demonstrate implementation of the program(s).</Run></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph><Table CellSpacing="0" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Table.Columns><TableColumn Width="43" /><TableColumn Width="284.33" /><TableColumn Width="284.33" /><TableColumn Width="252.27" /></Table.Columns><TableRowGroup><TableRow><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,4.13,3.4" BorderThickness="1,1,0,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF204C81"><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell ColumnSpan="3" Padding="7.13,7.47,4.13,3.4" BorderThickness="0,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF204C81"><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="190.4,0,0,0"><Run FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#FFFFFFFF">CIP-004-6 Table R3-- </Run><Span FontFamily="Calibri"><Run> </Run></Span><Span FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#FFFFFFFF"><Run>Personnel Risk Assessment Program </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow><TableRow><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,4.13,3.4" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF5D85A9"><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.4,0,0,0"><Span FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#FFFFFFFF"><Run>Part </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,4.13,3.4" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF5D85A9"><Paragraph TextAlignment="Center" FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,2.93,0"><Span FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#FFFFFFFF"><Run>Applicable Systems </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,4.13,3.4" Border