r checklists, forensic analysis results, restoration records, and post-incident review notes related to Reportable Cyber Security Incidents. </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow></TableRowGroup></Table><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph></Section></FlowDocument>', N'Incident Reporting and Response Planning', N'Cyber Security Incident Response Plan Implementation and Testing', 0, NULL, N'SET.20231121.102310', NULL, NULL, 8571, 17, NULL, 27247)
