ic distribution system; or</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="20.27,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run>Training sign-in sheets.</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem></List></ListItem></List></TableCell></TableRow></TableRowGroup></Table><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><LineBreak /></Span></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph></Section></FlowDocument>', N'Recovery Plans for BES Cyber Systems', N'Recovery Plan Review, Update and Communication', 0, NULL, N'SET.20231121.102310', NULL, NULL, 8586, 81, NULL, 27262)
