un>Examples of acceptable evidence  include, but are not limited to:  </Run></Span></Paragraph><List MarkerStyle="Disc" Margin="0,0,0,0" Padding="0,0,0,0"><ListItem Margin="24.07,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,3,9.87"><Span><Run>Procedures for protecting and securely handling, which include topics such as storage, security during transit, and use of BES Cyber System Information; or</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="24.07,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,3,0"><Run>Records indicating that BES Cyber System Information is handled in a manner consistent with the entitys documented procedure(s).</Run></Paragraph></ListItem></List></TableCell></TableRow></TableRowGroup></Table><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph></Section></FlowDocument>', N'Information Protection', N'Information Protection', 0, NULL, N'SET.20231121.102310', NULL, NULL, 8603, 18, NULL, 27279)
