ri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,8"><Span><Run>An example of evidence may include, but is not limited to, architecture documents detailing the authentication factors used.  </Run></Span></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,9.87"><Span><Run>Examples of authenticators may include, but are not limited to,  </Run></Span></Paragraph><List MarkerStyle="Disc" Margin="0,0,0,0" Padding="0,0,0,0"><ListItem Margin="48.07,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,1.93"><Span><Run>Something the individual knows such as passwords or PINs. This does not include User ID;</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.07,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,1.8"><Span><Run>Something the individual has such as tokens, digital certificates, or smart cards; or</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.07,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run>Something the individual is such</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem></List><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="48.07,0,0,0"><Span><Run>as fingerprints, iris scans, or other biometric characteristics.</Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow></TableRowGroup></Table><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><LineBreak /></Span></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph></Section></FlowDocument>', N'Electronic Security Perimeter(s)', N'Interactive Remote Access Management', 0, NULL, N'SET.20231121.102310', NULL, NULL, 8518, 4, NULL, 27194)
