in="0,0,0,9.8"><Span><Run>Records of response processes for malicious code detection</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="33.47,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run>Records of the performance of these processes when malicious code is detected.</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem></List></TableCell></TableRow><TableRow><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,7.67,0" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000"><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span FontFamily="Calibri"><Run>3.3</Run></Span><Span FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold"><Run> </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,7.67,0" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,1"><Span><Run>High Impact BES Cyber Systems and their associated: </Run></Span></Paragraph><List MarkerStyle="Decimal" Margin="0,0,0,0" Padding="0,0,0,0"><ListItem Margin="48.13,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,2.47"><Span><Run>EACMS;</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.13,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,2.47"><Span><Run>PACS; and</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.13,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,36.93"><Span><Run>PCA</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem></List><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,0.87"><Span><Run>Medium Impact BES Cyber Systems and their associated: </Run></Span></Paragraph><List MarkerStyle="Decimal" Margin="0,0,0,0" Padding="0,0,0,0"><ListItem Margin="48.13,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,2.33"><Span><Run>EACMS;</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.13,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,2.47"><Span><Run>PACS; and</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.13,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run>PCA</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem></List></TableCell><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,7.67,0" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000"><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,0"><Span FontFamily="Calibri"><Run>For those methods identified in Part 3.1 that use signatures or patterns, have a process for the update of the signatures or patterns. The process must address testing and installing the signatures or patterns.</Run></Span><Span FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold"><Run> </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,7.67,0" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,0"><Span><Run>An example of evidence may include, but is not limited to, documentation showing the process used for the update of signatures or patterns. </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow></TableRowGroup></Table><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph></Section></FlowDocument>', N'System Security Management', N'Malicious Code Prevention', 0, NULL, N'SET.20231121.102310', NULL, NULL, 8548, 25, NULL, 27224)
