y plan(s) that collectively include the applicable requirement parts in CIP-009-6 Table R1-- Recovery Plan Specifications.</Run></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="62.4,0,0.13,15.53"></Paragraph><Table CellSpacing="0" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Table.Columns><TableColumn Width="64.67" /><TableColumn Width="266.4" /><TableColumn Width="266.53" /><TableColumn Width="266.33" /></Table.Columns><TableRowGroup><TableRow><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,4.6,0" BorderThickness="1,1,0,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF204C81"><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell ColumnSpan="3" Padding="7.13,7.47,4.6,0" BorderThickness="0,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF204C81"><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="196,0,0,0"><Run FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#FFFFFFFF">CIP-009-6 Table R1--Recovery Plan Specifications </Run></Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow><TableRow><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,4.6,0" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF5D85A9"><Paragraph TextAlignment="Center" FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,2.73,0"><Span FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#FFFFFFFF"><Run>Part </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,4.6,0" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF5D85A9"><Paragraph TextAlignment="Center" FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,2.47,0"><Span FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#FFFFFFFF"><Run>Applicable Systems </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,4.6,0" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF5D85A9"><Paragraph TextAlignment="Center" FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,2.67,0"><Span FontFamily="